  "notes": "## 0.9.0-alpha.1 - 2026-05-12\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a plain-text paste shortcut in the quick panel: hold Option/Alt when pressing Enter, clicking an item, or using Command/Ctrl plus a number to paste without formatting.\n- Expand appearance settings with separate light and dark theme presets, clickable previews, a Follow system toggle, and custom colors for accent, background, foreground, and borders.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.9.0-alpha.1 - 2026-05-12\n\n### Features\n\n- 在快捷面板中支持按住 Option/Alt 以纯文本粘贴，适用于回车、点击条目以及 Command/Ctrl 加数字快捷键。\n- 外观设置现在可分别配置浅色和深色主题预设，并支持预览切换、跟随系统开关以及自定义强调色、背景色、前景色和边框色。",
